[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7800.47, "timestamp": "02:10:00", "text": "呃，所以我帮 YouTuber 存档一些东西，比如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7802.55, "timestamp": "02:10:02", "text": "什么时候会有YouTuber毕业？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7804.709, "timestamp": "02:10:04", "text": "如果没人做，我也会把她的东西存档。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7808.55, "timestamp": "02:10:08", "text": "存档是为了把它放到网上供人们阅读。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7811.75, "timestamp": "02:10:11", "text": "享受它，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7813.83, "timestamp": "02:10:13", "text": "一位毕业的油管博主，感觉就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7815.75, "timestamp": "02:10:15", "text": "小型 YouTuber"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7817.51, "timestamp": "02:10:17", "text": "所以我觉得，好吧，我是唯一一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7821.189, "timestamp": "02:10:21", "text": "谁负责存档？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7824.31, "timestamp": "02:10:24", "text": "所以我把它存档了，然后告诉了福克斯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7825.91, "timestamp": "02:10:25", "text": "也请将其存档，因为这些文件是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7833.91, "timestamp": "02:10:33", "text": "她照做了，文件也确实被保存了下来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7837.99, "timestamp": "02:10:37", "text": "加起来大概有200GB吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7840.87, "timestamp": "02:10:40", "text": "某物。哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7844.27, "timestamp": "02:10:44", "text": "她必须把那些寄给我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7847.83, "timestamp": "02:10:47", "text": "圣。等等，如果是200吉米，让我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7850.87, "timestamp": "02:10:50", "text": "猜测。她不得不购买数据流量套餐"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7854.43, "timestamp": "02:10:54", "text": "又是30MB的东西，尽管它实际上并没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7857.75, "timestamp": "02:10:57", "text": "已到期。这种情况我也遇到过几次。"}]